#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dt.strftime.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dt.strftime"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.DatelikeOps.strftime:1
msgid "Convert to Index using specified date_format."
msgstr "使用指定的 date_format 转换为索引。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.DatelikeOps.strftime:3
msgid ""
"Return an Index of formatted strings specified by date_format, which "
"supports the same string format as the python standard library. Details "
"of the string format can be found in `python string format doc "
"<https://docs.python.org/3/library/datetime.html #strftime-and-strptime-"
"behavior>`__."
msgstr ""
"返回由 date_format 指定的格式化字符串的 Index，其支持与 Python 标准库相同的字符串格式。"
"字符串格式的详细信息可以在 `python string format doc "
"<https://docs.python.org/3/library/datetime.html #strftime-and-strptime-"
"behavior>`__ 中找到。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.DatelikeOps.strftime:9
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Formats supported by the C `strftime` API but not by the python string "
"format doc (such as `\"%R\"`, `\"%r\"`) are not officially supported and "
"should be preferably replaced with their supported equivalents (such as "
"`\"%H:%M\"`, `\"%I:%M:%S %p\"`)."
msgstr ""
"C `strftime` API 支持但 python 字符串格式文档不支持的格式（例如 `\"%R\"`,"
" `\"%r\"`）未被官方支持，应首选替换为其支持的等价格式（例如 `\"%H:%M\"`, "
"`\"%I:%M:%S %p\"`）。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.DatelikeOps.strftime:14
msgid ""
"Note that `PeriodIndex` support additional directives, detailed in "
"`Period.strftime`."
msgstr "注意 `PeriodIndex` 支持额外的指令，在 `Period.strftime` 中有详细说明。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dt.strftime.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.DatelikeOps.strftime:17
msgid "Date format string (e.g. \"%%Y-%%m-%%d\")."
msgstr "日期格式字符串（例如 \"%%Y-%%m-%%d\"）。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dt.strftime.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.DatelikeOps.strftime:20
msgid "NumPy ndarray of formatted strings."
msgstr "格式化字符串的 NumPy ndarray。"

